 "moshi_text": "Hi there, how can I help you? A little bit of both, I think. You know, I've always enjoyed the texture of comquat, but also the sweetness of a moldberry. It' like a unique combination, you know. I can't really put my finger on it. Do you think it' just the fact that they're both sweet and juicy? Maybe that's why it's hard to nail it down. I' not sure if it's the combination of the two, or if it's something else entirely. It' just a unique taste, that's for sure. Maybe it's the fact that they're both refreshing, or maybe it's just the fact that they're both fruit. I don't know. It's just a mix of flavors that is so unique, it's hard to put a finger on it.",
